      "role": "user",
      "content": "that makes sense. u mentioned the complexity of managing a distributed system and the risks of managing all those different nodes. in a real production environment, what are the most common \"unpredictable\" issues or tiny errors that tend to pop up when you're trying to keep everything in sync? like, what kind of small things usually break things unexpectedly?",
